.TH L10N-CONV 1 "February 2026" "l10n-conv 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
l10n-conv \- universal localization file converter, validator, and compiler
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B l10n-conv
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
l10n-conv converts, validates, and compiles localization files across 16+ formats
including Gettext PO/MO, Qt TS/QM, XLIFF, Android XML, iOS Strings, JSON, YAML,
and many more.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B convert \fIINPUT\fR [\-f FORMAT] [\-\-to FORMAT] [\-o OUTPUT]
Convert between localization formats. Auto-detects input format.
.TP
.B compile \fIINPUT\fR \-o \fIOUTPUT\fR
Compile PO\(->MO or TS\(->QM.
.TP
.B extract \fISOURCE_DIR\fR \-o \fIOUTPUT\fR
Extract translatable strings from source code (Python, C/C++, JS/TS, QML).
.TP
.B check \fIFILE\fR
Validate a localization file for issues.
.TP
.B stats \fIFILE\fR
Show translation statistics.
.TP
.B merge \fIBASE\fR \fIUPDATE\fR \-o \fIOUTPUT\fR
Merge two localization files.
.TP
.B diff \fIFILE1\fR \fIFILE2\fR
Show differences between two files.
.TP
.B init \fITEMPLATE\fR \-l \fILANG\fR \-o \fIOUTPUT\fR
Create a new language file from a template.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-verbose
Verbose output.
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Preview without writing files.
.TP
.B \-\-batch
Process directories recursively.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show version.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Error.
.TP
.B 2
Warnings found.
